# Requirements
# - VSCodeプラグイン REST Client

### 都道府県
GET http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/ui/option/pref
Authorization: TEST_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

### 産業分類
GET http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/ui/option/industry
Authorization: Bearer TEST_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

### 同意取得区分
GET http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/ui/option/consent-route
Authorization: Bearer TEST_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

### 同意取得区分
GET http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/ui/option/consent-route?group_code=1
Authorization: TEST_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

### 同意取得区分
GET http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/ui/option/consent-route?group_code=1&org_id=ASE
Authorization: Bearer TEST_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

### 同意取得区分
GET http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/ui/option/consent-route?org_id=ASE
Authorization: TEST_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json
